{"title":"计算机科学入门班报名","comparisons":{"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200410.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200326.html","to":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200410.html","from_date":"2020-03-26","to_date":"2020-04-10","counts":{"added":4,"removed":0,"changed":2},"preview":"如果从书籍的覆盖面来看，我试图包括以下书籍的精华内容：","html":"<div class=\"diff-context\">课程内容</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">如果从书籍的覆盖面来看，我试图包括以下<del>基本</del>书<ins>籍</ins>的精华内容：</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><ins>课程重点在于应用层面的思维方式，</ins>不包<del>含解释器，编译器，PL 理论内容</del><ins>括语言底层实现</ins>。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><li>不包含解释器，编译器，PL 理论等内容。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">课时和收费</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><li>上课时间安排在国内时间下班后，晚上 8 点的样子。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">申请方式</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><h3 id=\"开始时间\">开始时间</h3></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>我打算在一两周之内安排面试申请者，准备一两次课的内容，然后开始教学。</p></div>"},"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200510.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200410.html","to":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200510.html","from_date":"2020-04-10","to_date":"2020-05-10","counts":{"added":4,"removed":3,"changed":8},"preview":"(2020.04.28 更新：半个月过去了，却似乎过了一年。零基础的同学们得到了让我有点吃惊的进步，我为此感到欣慰。同学们也反应一周两节课已经忙不过来，因为我会给他们很多练习，引导他们进行独立思考。所以考虑之后，决定把课程的间隔改为一…","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>(2020.04.28 更新：半个月过去了，却似乎过了一年。零基础的同学们得到了让我有点吃惊的进步，我为此感到欣慰。同学们也反应一周两节课已经忙不过来，因为我会给他们很多练习，引导他们进行独立思考。所以考虑之后，决定把课程的间隔改为一周一次，这样课后有充足的时间来练习，消化，吸收。）</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>(2020.04.16 更新：经过一段时间的准备，第一期的计算机科学基础课程已于 4 月 13 日星期一顺利启动。由于人数和时区限制，后来报名的同学会被安排到下一期参加。另外由于北美时区关系，可能会有一个专门的“北美班”，等待合适的时间启动。欢迎大家继续报名。描述请说明希望报名参加“第二期中国班”还是“第一期北美班”。）</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">授课方式和理念</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">采用网络授课方式<del>，需要签署版权保密协议</del>。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>主要采用问答互动教学，大家</del><ins>有聊天室</ins>讨论<ins>课程内容，有合适数量</ins>的<del>方式</del><ins>作业和思考题</ins>。<del>会有少量幻灯片和动画。</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>具有灵活性</del><ins>无教条主义，无死知识</ins>。<del>根据实际教学情况，决定下一堂课的内容。</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><li>其余时间有专用聊天室讨论课程内容，有少量作业，思考题。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><li>无教条主义，无死知识，无人不懂。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">课时和收费</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">因为是第一次授课，所以时间只是初步估计，到时候要以实际情况为准。<del>第一次授课有一定随机性，收费可能比稳定之后低一些。</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">估计<del>一</del><ins>两</ins>个月完成课程。如果中途有事耽搁，或者感觉太紧凑无法消化，可能按需少许延长。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">每周 <del>2</del><ins>1</ins> 次课，总共 8 次。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">人员要求</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><li>不好为人师。我们这里没有老师和学生之分。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">申请方式</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">简单自我介绍。教育经历，工作单位，工作内容，<del>职级，</del>上课的动机等。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">你的时区<ins>，因为可能按时区分班</ins>。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">开始时间</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><h3 id=\"全个性化课程\">全个性化课程</h3></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>2020.04.30 经过一段时间的实验，我推出了新的个性化课程。如果考虑一对一的教学，你可以参考<a href=\"http://www.yinwang.org/blog-cn/2020/04/30/individualized-learning\">这篇文章</a>。班级授课的模式仍然会继续进行，只是你可以有两种选择。</p></div>"},"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200609.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200510.html","to":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200609.html","from_date":"2020-05-10","to_date":"2020-06-09","counts":{"added":2,"removed":6,"changed":8},"preview":"(2020.05.29 更新：根据实际授课情况，更改了课程的内容简介。去掉了一些可有可无的内容，增加了解释器等关键的内容。）","html":"<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><p>(2020.05.29 更新：根据实际授课情况，更改了课程的内容简介。去掉了一些可有可无的内容，增加了解释器等关键的内容。）</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">课程内容</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">基础语言构造<del>和计算原理。</del><ins>，</ins>包含最常用几种语言的主要特性。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">递归思想<del>。</del><ins>，</ins>递归数据结构的处理。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-added\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><li>基本数据结构，少量基础算法。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>面向对象思想。</del>抽象<del>，模块</del>的思维方式。</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>类型系统思想</del><ins>基础的解释器原理</ins>。<del>涵盖所有编程语言的统一思维方式。</del></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><li>编程思想与硬件设计，操作系统之间的关系。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><li>计算理论（lambda calculus，图灵机，停机问题等）。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><li>如果时间允许，可选少许中级内容（逻辑式编程，初级定理证明等）。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">SICP<del>，HtDP</del><ins>（前 4 章）</ins></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\">可能有少许<del> Haskell，Typed Racket，Ceylon 的</del><ins>其它语言</ins>例子</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><p>不包含的内容：</p></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><li>课程重点在于应用层面的思维方式，不包括语言底层实现。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><li>不包含解释器，编译器，PL 理论等内容。</li></div>\n<div class=\"diff-context\">开始时间</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>全个性化</del><ins>一对一</ins>课程</div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>2020.04.30 </del>经过一段时间的实验，我推出了新的<del>个性化</del><ins>一对一</ins>课程<ins>方式</ins>。如果考虑一对一的教学，你可以参考这篇文章。班级授课的模式仍然会继续进行，只是你可以有两种选择。</div></div>"},"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200709.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200609.html","to":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200709.html","from_date":"2020-06-09","to_date":"2020-07-09","counts":{"added":0,"removed":1,"changed":4},"preview":"你将受到的训练","html":"<div class=\"diff-context\">课程内容</div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>会接触</del><ins>你将受</ins>到的<del>语言：</del><ins>训练</ins></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>Scheme</del><ins>掌握系统化的思维方法，严密的推理技巧</ins></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>JavaScript</del><ins>写出简单，优雅，容易理解，可靠的代码</ins></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-changed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">±</span><div class=\"diff-inline\"><del>Java</del><ins>从无到有，不依赖于任何语言的特性，解决各种计算问题的思路</ins></div></div>\n<div class=\"diff-block diff-removed\"><span class=\"diff-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">−</span><li>可能有少许其它语言例子</li></div>"},"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20240602.html":{"from":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20200709.html","to":"blog-cn_2020_03_26_entry-level-class_20240602.html","from_date":"2020-07-09","to_date":"2024-06-02","counts":{"added":0,"removed":0,"changed":0},"preview":"","html":"<p class=\"diff-empty\">两个版本的正文没有可见差异。</p>"}}}